OL,3,APassengers helped stop knife attack in
OL,4,Acockpit of Israel-bound plane,
OL,5,Awitnesses say
OL,6,
OL,7,FPassengers say a pilot on a Dubai to
OL,8,FTel Aviv flight was stabbed before the
OL,9,Fplane was diverted to Saudi Arabia -
OL,10,Fhere's what we know so far
OL,12,FThe airport where the plane landed says
OL,13,Fboth the captain and first officer
OL,14,Fsustained injuries - but does not say
OL,15,Fhow. Both have been taken to hospital
OL,17,FOne passenger reports "terrible screams
OL,18,Fthroughout the plane" before "three to
OL,19,Ffive guys burst into the cockpit" and
OL,20,Fsubdued the attacker
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
