OL,3,APassengers helped stop knife attack in
OL,4,Acockpit of Israel-bound plane,
OL,5,Awitnesses say
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnother passenger says "we took control
OL,8,Fof the flight" from "an assailant with
OL,9,Fa knife" - while two other pilots,
OL,10,Fsitting at the back, reportedly came
OL,11,Fforward to land the plane
OL,13,FThe Flydubai plane signalled an
OL,14,Femergency code two hours into the
OL,15,Fflight. It then switched to a hijacking
OL,16,Fcode but returned to a general
OL,17,Femergency signal
OL,19,FData shows how the plane plummeted
OL,20,F17,000ft (5,200m) in less than two
OL,21,Fminutes
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
